msgid "Web Pixel Studio Cookie Consent for EU"
msgstr "Web Pixel Studio Cookie Consent for EU"

msgid "GDPR & ePrivacy compliant cookie consent manager with Consent Mode v2 support, full customization, consent logging, and cookie blocking."
msgstr "Upravljalnik soglasij za piškotke, skladen z GDPR in ePrivacy, s podporo za Consent Mode v2, popolno prilagodljivostjo, beleženjem soglasij in blokiranjem piškotkov."

